<div class="mockup-calorias-diarias" set:html={`
  <div class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb">Nutrición / Calorías diarias</div><div class="heroGrid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Tu energía, explicada</span><h1>Tus calorías no son un número fijo.</h1><p class="heroCopy">Calculá cuánto necesita tu cuerpo para mantener, bajar o subir de peso. Te mostramos de dónde sale el resultado y cómo convertirlo en un plan posible.</p><div class="trust"><span>✓ Fórmula Mifflin–St Jeor</span><span>✓ Sin falsas promesas</span><span>✓ Resultado personalizable</span></div>
      <div class="visual"><div class="rings"><div><span><strong id="ringKcal">2.200</strong>kcal diarias</span></div></div><div class="visualText"><div class="legend"><i class="dot" style="background:var(--coral)"></i>Metabolismo basal</div><div class="legend"><i class="dot" style="background:var(--yellow)"></i>Actividad diaria</div><div class="legend"><i class="dot" style="background:var(--green)"></i>Digestión y ajuste</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="calc"><h2>Armá tu objetivo</h2><p class="calcSub">Podés cambiar los datos y comparar escenarios.</p><label class="label">¿Qué querés lograr?</label><div class="goals"><button class="goal active" data-goal="maintain">Mantener</button><button class="goal" data-goal="lose">Bajar peso</button><button class="goal" data-goal="gain">Ganar músculo</button><button class="goal" data-goal="target">Llegar a un peso</button></div>
      <div class="fields"><div class="field"><label class="label">Peso actual</label><input id="weight" type="number" min="35" max="250" value="75"></div><div class="field"><label class="label">Altura</label><input id="height" type="number" min="130" max="230" value="172"></div><div class="field"><label class="label">Edad</label><input id="age" type="number" min="18" max="90" value="35"></div><div class="field"><label class="label">Sexo biológico</label><select id="sex"><option value="male">Masculino</option><option value="female">Femenino</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label class="label">Actividad habitual</label><select id="activity"><option value="1.2">Sedentaria · casi sin ejercicio</option><option value="1.375">Ligera · 1 a 3 días por semana</option><option value="1.55" selected>Moderada · 3 a 5 días por semana</option><option value="1.725">Alta · 6 a 7 días por semana</option></select></div><div class="targetFields" id="targetFields"><div class="field"><label class="label">Peso objetivo</label><input id="targetWeight" type="number" min="35" max="250" value="70"></div><div class="field"><label class="label">Plazo en semanas</label><input id="weeks" type="number" min="4" max="104" value="12"></div></div></div>
      <button class="primary" id="calculate">Actualizar mi plan</button>
      <div class="result"><div class="resultTop"><div><div class="resultLabel">Tu objetivo diario</div><div class="kcal"><span id="targetKcal">2.638</span> <small>kcal</small></div></div><div class="badge" id="goalBadge">Mantener peso</div></div><div class="resultGrid"><div class="metric"><small>Mantenimiento</small><strong id="maintenance">2.638 kcal</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Proteína</small><strong id="protein">105 g</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Agua</small><strong id="water">2,6 L</strong></div></div><div class="macrobar"><i id="proteinBar" style="width:20%;background:#ef765f"></i><i id="carbBar" style="width:50%;background:#f6c85f"></i><i id="fatBar" style="width:30%;background:#4aa483"></i></div><div class="macroLegend"><span id="proteinLegend">Proteína 105 g</span><span id="carbLegend">Carbohidratos 369 g</span><span id="fatLegend">Grasas 60 g</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></div></div>
  <section><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionHead"><span class="eyebrow">El número, sin misterio</span><h2>De dónde salen tus calorías</h2><p>No es una cifra mágica: es la suma de la energía que tu cuerpo usa para vivir, moverse y procesar alimentos.</p></div><div class="breakdown"><div class="card"><div class="icon">♥</div><h3>Metabolismo basal</h3><p>La energía mínima para respirar, circular sangre y sostener tus órganos.</p><div class="big" id="bmrCard">1.686 kcal</div></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">↗</div><h3>Movimiento y actividad</h3><p>Incluye tu rutina cotidiana y el ejercicio que declaraste arriba.</p><div class="big" id="activityCard">688 kcal</div></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">≈</div><h3>Digestión y variación</h3><p>Una estimación razonable del costo digestivo y del margen diario.</p><div class="big" id="thermicCard">264 kcal</div></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="pale"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionHead"><span class="eyebrow">Compará antes de elegir</span><h2>Tres ritmos posibles</h2><p>Tocá un escenario para aplicarlo en la calculadora.</p></div><div class="scenarioGrid"><button class="scenario" data-scenario="lose"><strong>Déficit moderado</strong><b id="loseScenario">2.138 kcal</b><span>Una referencia gradual de −500 kcal por día.</span></button><button class="scenario recommended" data-scenario="maintain"><span class="tag">PUNTO DE PARTIDA</span><strong>Mantenimiento</strong><b id="maintainScenario">2.638 kcal</b><span>Para sostener el peso con tu actividad actual.</span></button><button class="scenario" data-scenario="gain"><strong>Superávit controlado</strong><b id="gainScenario">2.938 kcal</b><span>Un extra moderado para acompañar fuerza y músculo.</span></button></div></div></section>
  <section><div class="wrap"><div class="guide"><div><span class="eyebrow">Usalo como una brújula</span><h2>El mejor cálculo es el que podés ajustar.</h2><div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><div><strong>Empezá con la estimación</strong><p>No hace falta perseguir el número perfecto desde el primer día.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><div><strong>Observá 3 a 4 semanas</strong><p>Registrá energía, hambre, rendimiento y tendencia del peso.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><div><strong>Ajustá de a poco</strong><p>Si el objetivo no avanza, cambiá 100–200 kcal y volvé a observar.</p></div></div></div></div><aside class="note"><h3>Un límite también cuida</h3><p>La calculadora evita sugerir valores demasiado bajos. Embarazo, lactancia, adolescencia, enfermedades metabólicas o antecedentes de trastornos alimentarios requieren acompañamiento profesional.</p><div class="limits"><div class="limit"><small>Piso orientativo · mujer</small><strong>1.200 kcal</strong></div><div class="limit"><small>Piso orientativo · varón</small><strong>1.500 kcal</strong></div></div></aside></div></div></section>
`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-calorias-diarias')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-calorias-diarias');if(!root)return;

  let goal='maintain';
  const $=id=>root.querySelector("#"+id);
  const fmt=n=>Math.round(n).toLocaleString('es-AR');
  const clamp=(n,min,max)=>Math.min(max,Math.max(min,n));
  function applyGoal(next){
    goal=next;
    root.querySelectorAll('.goal').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.goal===goal));
    $('targetFields').classList.toggle('show',goal==='target');
    calculate();
    root.querySelector('.calc').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});
  }
  function calculate(){
    const w=clamp(Number($('weight').value)||75,35,250), h=clamp(Number($('height').value)||172,130,230), a=clamp(Number($('age').value)||35,18,90);
    const male=$('sex').value==='male', factor=Number($('activity').value);
    const bmr=10*w+6.25*h-5*a+(male?5:-161), tdee=bmr*factor, floor=male?1500:1200;
    let calories=tdee,label='Mantener peso';
    if(goal==='lose'){calories=Math.max(floor,tdee-500);label='Déficit moderado'}
    if(goal==='gain'){calories=tdee+300;label='Ganar músculo'}
    if(goal==='target'){
      const target=clamp(Number($('targetWeight').value)||w,35,250), weeks=clamp(Number($('weeks').value)||12,4,104);
      calories=Math.max(floor,tdee+((target-w)*7700)/(weeks*7));
      label=target<w?'Hacia tu peso objetivo':target>w?'Subida gradual':'Mantener peso';
    }
    const proteinRate=goal==='lose'?2:goal==='gain'?1.8:1.4, protein=Math.round(w*proteinRate), fat=Math.round(w*.8);
    const carbs=Math.max(0,Math.round((calories-protein*4-fat*9)/4)), water=w*.035;
    const proteinPct=clamp(protein*4/calories*100,10,45), fatPct=clamp(fat*9/calories*100,15,45), carbPct=Math.max(0,100-proteinPct-fatPct);
    $('targetKcal').textContent=fmt(calories); $('ringKcal').textContent=fmt(calories); $('maintenance').textContent=fmt(tdee)+' kcal'; $('goalBadge').textContent=label;
    $('protein').textContent=protein+' g'; $('water').textContent=water.toLocaleString('es-AR',{minimumFractionDigits:1,maximumFractionDigits:1})+' L';
    $('proteinLegend').textContent='Proteína '+protein+' g'; $('carbLegend').textContent='Carbohidratos '+carbs+' g'; $('fatLegend').textContent='Grasas '+fat+' g';
    $('proteinBar').style.width=proteinPct+'%'; $('carbBar').style.width=carbPct+'%'; $('fatBar').style.width=fatPct+'%';
    const thermic=tdee*.1, activity=Math.max(0,tdee-bmr-thermic);
    $('bmrCard').textContent=fmt(bmr)+' kcal'; $('activityCard').textContent=fmt(activity)+' kcal'; $('thermicCard').textContent=fmt(thermic)+' kcal';
    $('loseScenario').textContent=fmt(Math.max(floor,tdee-500))+' kcal'; $('maintainScenario').textContent=fmt(tdee)+' kcal'; $('gainScenario').textContent=fmt(tdee+300)+' kcal';
  }
  root.querySelectorAll('.goal').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>applyGoal(b.dataset.goal)));
  root.querySelectorAll('.scenario').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>applyGoal(b.dataset.scenario)));
  root.querySelectorAll('input,select').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('input',calculate));
  $('calculate').addEventListener('click',()=>{calculate();const old=$('calculate').textContent;$('calculate').textContent='✓ Plan actualizado';setTimeout(()=>$('calculate').textContent=old,1100)});
  calculate();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

    .mockup-calorias-diarias{--ink:#17213b;--muted:#667085;--line:#e5e9e4;--paper:#fbfcf8;--white:#fff;--green:#18745a;--mint:#dff4e9;--coral:#ef765f;--peach:#fff0ea;--yellow:#f6c85f;--navy:#102d3c;--shadow:0 22px 60px rgba(26,55,45,.10)}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-calorias-diarias{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}.mockup-calorias-diarias .wrap{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias header{height:82px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;background:rgba(251,252,248,.94);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}.mockup-calorias-diarias nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .brand{font-weight:850;font-size:19px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .logo{width:33px;height:39px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#264f62,#102d3c);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-size:18px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .links{display:flex;gap:25px;font-weight:650;font-size:14px;color:#4a5568}.mockup-calorias-diarias .actions{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:9px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .smallBtn{padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:white;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias .hero{padding:58px 0 74px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 12% 15%,#e7f6ed 0,transparent 29%),radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%,#ffede6 0,transparent 27%)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .crumb{font-size:14px;color:var(--green);font-weight:750;margin-bottom:20px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .heroGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:64px;align-items:start}.mockup-calorias-diarias .eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;color:var(--green);font-size:12px;font-weight:850}.mockup-calorias-diarias .hero h1{font-size:58px;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:13px 0 20px;max-width:590px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .heroCopy{font-size:19px;line-height:1.55;color:#556070;max-width:560px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .trust{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:27px;flex-wrap:wrap}.mockup-calorias-diarias .trust span{padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid #d9e7dd;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);border-radius:100px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#375348}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias .visual{margin-top:42px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .rings{width:154px;height:154px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(var(--coral) 0 46%,var(--yellow) 46% 71%,var(--green) 71% 100%);padding:15px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .rings>div{height:100%;border-radius:50%;background:var(--paper);display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .rings strong{display:block;font-size:26px;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .visualText{display:grid;gap:12px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias .calc{background:white;border:1px solid #dfe6df;border-radius:26px;padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .calc h2{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.mockup-calorias-diarias .calcSub{margin:0 0 23px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .label{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#53605b;margin:0 0 8px;display:block}.mockup-calorias-diarias .goals{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px;margin-bottom:20px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .goal{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fafbf9;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 5px;color:#556070;font-weight:750;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.mockup-calorias-diarias .goal.active{color:var(--green);border-color:#73b49d;background:#ebf7f0;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(24,116,90,.08)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-calorias-diarias .field input,.mockup-calorias-diarias .field select{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #d9dfda;border-radius:12px;padding:0 13px;background:white;color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-weight:650;outline:none}.mockup-calorias-diarias .field input:focus,.mockup-calorias-diarias .field select:focus{border-color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(24,116,90,.1)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .targetFields{display:none;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-calorias-diarias .targetFields.show{display:grid}.mockup-calorias-diarias .primary{width:100%;height:52px;border:0;border-radius:13px;background:var(--green);color:white;font:inherit;font-weight:850;margin-top:19px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 9px 22px rgba(24,116,90,.2)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias .result{margin-top:18px;background:var(--navy);color:white;border-radius:19px;padding:22px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .resultTop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.mockup-calorias-diarias .resultLabel{color:#b8d0d5;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:800}.mockup-calorias-diarias .kcal{font-size:39px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.05em}.mockup-calorias-diarias .kcal small{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;color:#c6d4d7}.mockup-calorias-diarias .badge{background:#244a58;border:1px solid #416471;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:99px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.mockup-calorias-diarias .resultGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px;margin-top:18px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .metric{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:12px;border-radius:12px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .metric small{display:block;color:#b9cacc;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .metric strong{font-size:16px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .macrobar{display:flex;height:9px;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin:18px 0 10px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .macrobar i{display:block}.mockup-calorias-diarias .macroLegend{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#c8d4d7;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias section{padding:82px 0}.mockup-calorias-diarias .sectionHead{text-align:center;max-width:690px;margin:0 auto 40px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .sectionHead .eyebrow{display:block}.mockup-calorias-diarias .sectionHead h2{font-size:40px;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:10px 0 12px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .sectionHead p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}.mockup-calorias-diarias .breakdown{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .card{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:21px;padding:25px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .icon{width:43px;height:43px;border-radius:13px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--mint);color:var(--green);font-size:21px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .card h3{font-size:19px;margin:19px 0 8px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin:0}.mockup-calorias-diarias .card .big{font-size:31px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:20px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .pale{background:#f2f7f3}.mockup-calorias-diarias .scenarioGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .scenario{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;background:white;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;color:inherit}.mockup-calorias-diarias .scenario:hover{border-color:#8fbba9;transform:translateY(-2px)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .scenario strong{font-size:18px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .scenario b{font-size:27px;display:block;margin:13px 0 5px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .scenario span{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .scenario.recommended{border:2px solid var(--green);position:relative}.mockup-calorias-diarias .tag{position:absolute;right:13px;top:13px;font-size:10px!important;background:var(--mint);color:var(--green)!important;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:850}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias .guide{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:55px;align-items:center}.mockup-calorias-diarias .guide h2{font-size:42px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:10px 0 17px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .steps{display:grid;gap:15px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .step{display:flex;gap:14px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:17px;border-radius:16px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .num{flex:0 0 31px;height:31px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--peach);color:#b84e3a;font-weight:900}.mockup-calorias-diarias .step p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}.mockup-calorias-diarias .note{background:#fff9e9;border:1px solid #ead79b;border-radius:22px;padding:27px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .note h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .note p{color:#6f6346;line-height:1.55}.mockup-calorias-diarias .limits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px;margin-top:18px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .limit{background:white;border-radius:13px;padding:14px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .limit small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .limit strong{font-size:20px}
    .mockup-calorias-diarias footer{background:#102d3c;color:white;padding:48px 0;margin-top:20px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#b9c8cc}.mockup-calorias-diarias .foot strong{color:white}
    @media(max-width:900px){.mockup-calorias-diarias .links{display:none}.mockup-calorias-diarias .heroGrid,.mockup-calorias-diarias .guide{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-calorias-diarias .hero h1{font-size:46px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .breakdown,.mockup-calorias-diarias .scenarioGrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-calorias-diarias .heroGrid{gap:38px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .hero{padding-top:35px}}@media(max-width:560px){.mockup-calorias-diarias .wrap{width:min(100% - 24px,1180px)}.mockup-calorias-diarias .hero h1{font-size:39px}.mockup-calorias-diarias .goals{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-calorias-diarias .fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-calorias-diarias .field.full,.mockup-calorias-diarias .targetFields{grid-column:auto}.mockup-calorias-diarias .targetFields.show{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-calorias-diarias .resultGrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-calorias-diarias .visual{display:none}.mockup-calorias-diarias .macroLegend{gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.mockup-calorias-diarias .actions .smallBtn:first-child{display:none}}
  
.mockup-calorias-diarias{width:100%;overflow:hidden}
/* Keep the legacy site's global typography palette from overriding text that
   intentionally inherits a light color inside dark mockup surfaces. */
.mockup-calorias-diarias :where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,p,span,strong,b,small,em,i,a,label,button,summary,li,th,td){color:inherit}
.mockup-calorias-diarias input[type="number"]{-moz-appearance:textfield;appearance:textfield}
.mockup-calorias-diarias input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button,.mockup-calorias-diarias input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button{-webkit-appearance:none;margin:0}
</style>
